  monsterId: 8a04c5d04c844b5c8a5fd18076b80939
  displayName: Leprechaun
  portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: dc4578cdc53ebc9438c6e0c51d38da01, type: 3}
  description: 'A leprechaun is a small fae humanoid, shorter than a child, with
    a clever posture and quick hands. It moves at a deceptively calm normal pace
    - until it vanishes around a corner. Its weapon is its mouth: confident, teasing
    speech, full of bargains, half-truths, and misdirection, as if every word is
    part of a trick.'
